sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Patient
  participant A as AppointmentActivity
  participant D as CreneauDisponibleAdapter
  participant R as Room (DAO)
  P->>A: opens Rendez-vous
  A->>R: CreneauDao.getAll() (background thread)
  R-->>A: free slots + doctors
  P->>D: Réserver, optional reason
  D->>R: CreneauDao.getById(id)
  alt slot already taken
    D-->>P: Toast "Créneau déjà pris"
  else free
    D->>R: runInTransaction
    Note over R: insert RendezVous (confirmé)<br/>update Creneau disponible = 0
    D-->>P: Toast "Rendez-vous confirmé!"
  end
